1
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:43,799
Chu Wenfu has three regiments,

2
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,480
about 5,000 men.

3
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:46,400
Xiaoxian,

4
00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:49,099
take the Third Regiment of the Third Corps.

5
00:01:49,299 --> 00:01:50,079
Bingwen,

6
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:52,099
the Fifth Regiment of the Seventh Corps.

7
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:53,739
Close in at once

8
00:01:55,799 --> 00:01:56,980
and drive them back.

9
00:01:57,420 --> 00:01:57,859
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

10
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,480
When will our artillery get here?

11
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,980
Three days at the earliest.

12
00:02:02,459 --> 00:02:03,099
Three days?

13
00:02:03,780 --> 00:02:04,700
We can hold out.

14
00:02:04,819 --> 00:02:06,099
I'll have them pick up the pace.

15
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:17,240
Look who finally showed his face!

16
00:02:18,259 --> 00:02:20,280
Nanping's been ravaged!

17
00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:21,479
And where the hell was

18
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:22,400
my deputy commander?

19
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,800
What a disgrace!

20
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:24,960
Changxuan,

21
00:02:25,659 --> 00:02:26,360
Chu Wenfu launched

22
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,240
a sudden assault

23
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:28,280
on Nanping,

24
00:02:28,699 --> 00:02:29,560
our territory.

25
00:02:29,979 --> 00:02:31,580
Casualties are heavy.

26
00:02:31,759 --> 00:02:34,159
Over a 1,000 civilians are dead or wounded.

27
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:35,759
Our garrison battalion there was

28
00:02:35,979 --> 00:02:38,080
almost wiped out.

29
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,960
Major Yang, under Commander Xu,

30
00:02:41,139 --> 00:02:43,319
opposed the government's strike on Nanping.

31
00:02:43,780 --> 00:02:45,379
They executed him for colluding

32
00:02:47,979 --> 00:02:48,960
with rebels.

33
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:51,740
Major Yang...

34
00:02:51,740 --> 00:02:52,599
He was shot!

35
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:54,939
The central government

36
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,460
has officially

37
00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:58,199
branded us rebels.

38
00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:16,159
Bastards!

39
00:03:21,780 --> 00:03:23,259
Major Yang was my friend.

40
00:03:24,780 --> 00:03:26,199
He helped me so many times.

41
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:27,539
And the people

42
00:03:27,539 --> 00:03:28,300
and soldiers

43
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:29,539
of Nanhuai won't die in vain.

44
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:32,360
I never wanted a civil war.

45
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:35,419
But the central government and Chu Wenfu

46
00:03:35,419 --> 00:03:36,719
started this.

47
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,460
We have no choice but to fight.

48
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:49,939
Father,

49
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,479
put me in command.

50
00:04:04,139 --> 00:04:05,000
Young Master,

51
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,280
in the shape we're in,

52
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:07,060
are you really going

53
00:04:07,060 --> 00:04:07,979
to take Chu Wenfu head-on?

54
00:04:09,020 --> 00:04:10,020
Of course not.

55
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:12,319
Got a trick up your sleeve?

56
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:20,579
Chu Wenfu's army looks strong on paper,

57
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,139
but his ten thousand men

58
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:23,300
are his own troops thrown

59
00:04:23,379 --> 00:04:25,160
together with central government soldiers.

60
00:04:25,379 --> 00:04:27,500
Conflicting orders, divided loyalties.

61
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,759
He's desperate

62
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:31,060
for a big win to establish his authority,

63
00:04:31,839 --> 00:04:34,500
and that's his weak spot.

64
00:04:36,319 --> 00:04:38,500
He's cocky right now,

65
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:41,339
so we'll feign weakness.

66
00:04:48,139 --> 00:04:49,699
He's sure to order a pursuit.

67
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:50,860
Once his column

68
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:52,120
is strung out,

69
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,819
its head and tail get cut off.

70
00:04:54,339 --> 00:04:56,379
That's when we counterattack.

71
00:05:00,699 --> 00:05:01,279
Fire!

72
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:13,300
Then you'll

73
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,959
take a small unit around to their rear

74
00:05:15,259 --> 00:05:16,259
and burn their supplies.

75
00:05:16,660 --> 00:05:17,459
With chaos in the rear,

76
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,879
their whole front will collapse.

77
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,199
Ready.

78
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:26,459
Throw!

79
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,860
Charge!

80
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:43,360
Governor,

81
00:05:43,639 --> 00:05:44,079
we...

82
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:46,319
We walked right into Yu Changxuan's trap.

83
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,120
He used a small detachment as bait

84
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:49,439
to lure us into the valley.

85
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,540
His main force

86
00:05:50,839 --> 00:05:51,660
was lying in ambush

87
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:52,620
on both sides.

88
00:05:53,060 --> 00:05:54,860
Our vanguard is cut off,

89
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,579
and our supply wagons

90
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,839
in the rear were hit.

91
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:00,300
Every last one burned.

92
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:01,360
Our men

93
00:06:01,620 --> 00:06:03,600
don't have a single ration left.

94
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:36,540
Can't believe

95
00:06:37,420 --> 00:06:39,560
he actually turned the tide.

96
00:06:40,300 --> 00:06:41,139
At that meeting,

97
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:43,120
the plan was a frontal assault.

98
00:06:43,759 --> 00:06:46,000
But he later changed tack

99
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:48,139
and caught the Chu Army off guard.

100
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:49,800
Yu Changxuan's

101
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,000
getting more unpredictable.

102
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:52,759
At this rate,

103
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:55,160
he might actually win this battle.

104
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:56,100
Sir,

105
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,620
what's our next move?

106
00:07:01,860 --> 00:07:02,920
I'll sound him out

107
00:07:03,899 --> 00:07:05,680
over the next few days.

108
00:07:06,300 --> 00:07:07,420
Whatever it takes,

109
00:07:08,139 --> 00:07:09,019
I'll figure out

110
00:07:09,019 --> 00:07:10,319
his next move

111
00:07:11,379 --> 00:07:12,519
and get word to Governor Chu.

112
00:07:12,639 --> 00:07:13,199
Who's there?

113
00:08:01,579 --> 00:08:02,279
Sir,

114
00:08:03,379 --> 00:08:04,579
our men found Brigade Commander's body

115
00:08:04,579 --> 00:08:06,100
at the foot of a cliff.

116
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:07,639
It rained hard last night.

117
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,579
He'd gone to decode a telegram,

118
00:08:10,139 --> 00:08:11,459
and the roads were slippery.

119
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:14,240
We don't know exactly what happened yet.

120
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:16,180
Brigade Commander Zhang

121
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,620
served the Commander

122
00:08:19,579 --> 00:08:20,720
for half his life,

123
00:08:21,699 --> 00:08:23,459
and earned everyone's respect.

124
00:08:24,980 --> 00:08:26,660
Losing him in an accident like this

125
00:08:27,220 --> 00:08:27,699
is

126
00:08:27,699 --> 00:08:29,040
a blow to all of us.

127
00:08:32,639 --> 00:08:34,019
My condolences.

128
00:08:39,659 --> 00:08:40,759
Send someone to bring

129
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:43,120
Mr. Zhang's body back to Nanhuai at once

130
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,220
and lay him to rest.

131
00:08:45,919 --> 00:08:46,720
Make sure

132
00:08:48,559 --> 00:08:49,919
Mrs. Zhang is well looked after.

133
00:08:51,139 --> 00:08:51,940
Yes, sir.

134
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,659
Changxuan,

135
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:04,600
things are under control at the front.

136
00:09:05,580 --> 00:09:06,559
I'd like to go back.

137
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,179
You know

138
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:10,659
Father hasn't been well.

139
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,320
I don't trust

140
00:09:14,639 --> 00:09:15,179
anyone else

141
00:09:15,179 --> 00:09:16,460
to break the news about Mr. Zhang.

142
00:09:17,779 --> 00:09:19,360
I'd better tell him myself.

143
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:23,139
And Mr. Zhang's family will

144
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,919
need looking after too.

145
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:43,539
Thanks.

146
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,399
I'm off.

147
00:09:58,860 --> 00:09:59,679
Jinxuan?

148
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:03,960
Pingjun.

149
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,120
What are you doing here?

150
00:10:07,539 --> 00:10:09,000
It's good to finally see you.

151
00:10:12,820 --> 00:10:13,600
Pingjun,

152
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:15,779
we heard

153
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,620
about the baby.

154
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,580
Mother's worried about you.

155
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,320
How is everyone?

156
00:10:25,820 --> 00:10:27,360
Mother and the rest of us are fine.

157
00:10:27,940 --> 00:10:29,539
But Father keeps

158
00:10:29,639 --> 00:10:30,980
getting worse.

159
00:10:31,899 --> 00:10:32,820
What's wrong?

160
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:35,100
We don't know.

161
00:10:35,299 --> 00:10:36,600
He keeps coughing

162
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:37,919
and has severe headaches.

163
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:40,539
Days ago, he even coughed up blood.

164
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:43,620
Why all of a sudden?

165
00:10:44,100 --> 00:10:44,919
No one knows.

166
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,220
Lots of doctors have examined him,

167
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:49,139
and none could find the cause.

168
00:10:49,899 --> 00:10:51,440
Nothing they've prescribed

169
00:10:51,580 --> 00:10:53,019
has helped.

170
00:10:53,399 --> 00:10:56,120
His headaches only keep getting worse.

171
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,480
My mother

172
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,759
used to have

173
00:10:59,820 --> 00:11:01,379
coughs and headaches too.

174
00:11:01,779 --> 00:11:03,360
I found an old doctor

175
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,600
with a folk remedy,

176
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,539
and it worked wonders.

177
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:08,980
Why not have him take a look at Father?

178
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,399
Pingjun,

179
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:18,059
I know you still care about us.

180
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:21,360
You still think of us as family.

181
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:25,159
These are dangerous times.

182
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:26,899
How can we stop worrying

183
00:11:27,519 --> 00:11:29,399
with you out here on your own?

184
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:32,139
And deep down,

185
00:11:33,019 --> 00:11:34,399
I know you don't blame

186
00:11:34,899 --> 00:11:37,720
Changxuan for your mother's death.

187
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,740
Some things are just

188
00:11:39,740 --> 00:11:40,899
hard to let go of,

189
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:41,980
and some wounds

190
00:11:42,059 --> 00:11:43,480
take time to heal.

191
00:11:49,419 --> 00:11:50,759
Come home with me.

192
00:11:51,100 --> 00:11:52,220
Just to

193
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,980
put Mother's mind at ease.

194
00:11:55,519 --> 00:11:57,899
Father's sick,

195
00:11:58,519 --> 00:12:00,679
and Changxuan's gone to the front.

196
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:03,940
Mother's been on edge every day.

197
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,960
She'd be

198
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,899
so happy to have you back.

199
00:12:11,519 --> 00:12:13,220
Let's go find the doctor together,

200
00:12:13,539 --> 00:12:16,019
get the medicine,

201
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:18,519
and help Father get better.

202
00:12:19,139 --> 00:12:20,320
Once he sees you,

203
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,039
he might be

204
00:12:22,039 --> 00:12:23,179
so glad

205
00:12:23,500 --> 00:12:24,159
that he's

206
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:25,320
halfway cured.

207
00:12:25,559 --> 00:12:27,519
That would beat any miracle cure.

208
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:31,019
Pingjun,

209
00:12:31,519 --> 00:12:33,100
I'm begging you.

210
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:36,840
Come home with me, please?

211
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:08,600
Pingjun!

212
00:13:09,899 --> 00:13:10,600
- Mother.
- Pingjun.

213
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,139
Pingjun's back!

214
00:13:11,139 --> 00:13:11,840
You're really back?

215
00:13:12,019 --> 00:13:13,360
This isn't a dream, right?

216
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:14,440
Pingjun.

217
00:13:14,580 --> 00:13:15,159
Mother.

218
00:13:17,379 --> 00:13:17,980
My dear,

219
00:13:17,980 --> 00:13:19,480
you're finally home.

220
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:24,100
Do you know how worried

221
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:26,220
we've been since you left?

222
00:13:26,779 --> 00:13:27,899
With the war and everything,

223
00:13:27,899 --> 00:13:29,100
and you out there alone...

224
00:13:30,779 --> 00:13:31,720
Exactly. Pingjun,

225
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:32,620
we've thought

226
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:34,279
about you day and night.

227
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:36,500
Mother, she's home now.

228
00:13:37,019 --> 00:13:37,860
Right.

229
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:44,580
Over here.

230
00:13:47,519 --> 00:13:48,000
Mother,

231
00:13:48,559 --> 00:13:49,779
Jinxuan told me

232
00:13:49,879 --> 00:13:51,200
Father has been ill

233
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,179
with terrible headaches.

234
00:13:52,679 --> 00:13:53,259
So I found

235
00:13:53,259 --> 00:13:54,960
the folk remedy my mother used to take.

236
00:13:55,059 --> 00:13:55,980
It worked wonders.

237
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,919
I hope it'll help Father too.

238
00:13:58,399 --> 00:13:59,700
Good girl,

239
00:14:00,460 --> 00:14:02,399
you still care about us

240
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,419
and this family.

241
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:08,080
I'm so glad.

242
00:14:10,379 --> 00:14:12,559
Before Changxuan left for the front,

243
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:15,620
you were the one he worried about most.

244
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,500
Now that

245
00:14:20,620 --> 00:14:21,759
you're back,

246
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:23,580
just stay with us.

247
00:14:24,139 --> 00:14:25,779
Let's be

248
00:14:25,980 --> 00:14:27,639
a family again, all right?

249
00:14:28,519 --> 00:14:29,740
That's right, Pingjun.

250
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:31,399
This is your home.

251
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,720
Please stay.

252
00:14:35,299 --> 00:14:36,100
Pingjun,

253
00:14:36,620 --> 00:14:38,480
in times like these, we need to

254
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,620
stick together

255
00:14:39,919 --> 00:14:41,419
as a family

256
00:14:41,419 --> 00:14:42,519
and get through this together.

257
00:14:54,580 --> 00:14:54,960
Okay.

258
00:14:57,379 --> 00:14:57,700
Good girl.

259
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:58,639
Come, sit.

260
00:14:59,679 --> 00:15:00,799
Jinxuan, have a seat.

261
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:02,019
Thank you, dear.

262
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,039
Xiaoxian was

263
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:30,639
a bit bookish.

264
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:33,440
Some called him

265
00:15:33,980 --> 00:15:34,980
a stubborn pedant.

266
00:15:37,399 --> 00:15:39,179
But in every hard fight,

267
00:15:40,759 --> 00:15:42,320
he was always out front.

268
00:15:42,980 --> 00:15:44,340
Every Tomb-Sweeping Day,

269
00:15:44,779 --> 00:15:46,259
he'd burn extra

270
00:15:46,259 --> 00:15:48,259
paper offerings for the men we lost.

271
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,259
I asked him why.

272
00:15:51,799 --> 00:15:52,720
He said they'd

273
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,059
suffered enough in life

274
00:15:55,799 --> 00:15:56,759
and wanted to make

275
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:59,139
the afterlife easier for them.

276
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:02,820
Father,

277
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,100
please don't take it so hard.

278
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:07,679
Mr. Zhang's death

279
00:16:09,899 --> 00:16:11,000
was just an accident.

280
00:16:12,500 --> 00:16:14,080
Back then at headquarters,

281
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:17,100
a dozen of us could

282
00:16:18,039 --> 00:16:19,840
practically raise the roof.

283
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,460
Over the years,

284
00:16:23,279 --> 00:16:25,360
battle after battle,

285
00:16:26,500 --> 00:16:28,460
I've lost them one by one.

286
00:16:29,860 --> 00:16:30,779
Now

287
00:16:33,259 --> 00:16:35,039
even Xiaoxian's gone.

288
00:16:37,759 --> 00:16:38,379
Father,

289
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:41,279
you need to take care of yourself.

290
00:16:43,259 --> 00:16:44,240
Before I left,

291
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,419
Changxuan asked me

292
00:16:47,279 --> 00:16:48,860
to stay with you until you're well,

293
00:16:49,799 --> 00:16:51,059
and to tell you not to worry about him.

294
00:16:54,379 --> 00:16:54,840
Here,

295
00:16:55,159 --> 00:16:56,419
let me help you lie down for a bit.

296
00:16:56,580 --> 00:16:57,100
No need.

297
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:00,700
I'd like to be alone for a while.

298
