599
00:30:31,640 --> 00:30:32,559
Mother!

600
00:30:33,000 --> 00:30:33,900
Mother!

601
00:30:33,960 --> 00:30:34,660
Miss.

602
00:30:38,859 --> 00:30:40,000
Mother!

603
00:30:41,319 --> 00:30:42,759
Mother!

604
00:30:42,839 --> 00:30:44,099
Mother!

605
00:30:44,619 --> 00:30:46,160
Mother!

606
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,900
Let go of me, Kuang Bingwen!

607
00:30:49,660 --> 00:30:50,460
Let go!

608
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,019
