611
00:30:57,220 --> 00:30:58,019
Kuang Bingwen!

612
00:30:59,039 --> 00:30:59,400
Kuang Bingwen!

613
00:31:22,140 --> 00:31:23,099
Watch where you're going.

614
00:31:53,539 --> 00:31:54,039
After them!

615
00:31:58,240 --> 00:31:58,799
That way!

616
00:32:04,019 --> 00:32:04,660
