617
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:08,480
Out of town.

618
00:32:18,579 --> 00:32:19,019
Out!

619
00:32:19,559 --> 00:32:20,039
Get out!

620
00:32:21,980 --> 00:32:23,440
Let me go, Kuang Bingwen.

621
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:25,900
Let go! I said let go!

622
00:32:34,460 --> 00:32:35,339
Kuang Bingwen,

623
00:32:36,359 --> 00:32:37,759
