629
00:32:47,779 --> 00:32:48,599
Are you insane?

630
00:32:48,779 --> 00:32:50,000
I lost my mind long ago.

631
00:32:50,519 --> 00:32:51,500
Yu Jinxuan,

632
00:32:52,059 --> 00:32:53,039
we live and

633
00:32:53,039 --> 00:32:54,039
die together.

634
00:33:02,920 --> 00:33:03,839
Yu Jinxuan,

635
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:05,240
die!

636
00:33:43,960 --> 00:33:44,619
Jinxuan!

637
00:33:48,160 --> 00:33:48,900
Changxuan.

638
00:33:51,440 --> 00:33:52,160
Changxuan.

639
00:33:52,440 --> 00:33:53,079
Are you all right?

640
00:33:53,380 --> 00:33:53,960
I'm fine.

641
00:33:58,500 --> 00:33:59,240
Why?

642
00:34:01,579 --> 00:34:03,519
Why can't you let it go?

643
00:34:06,599 --> 00:34:07,480
And you?

644
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:10,860
Aren't

645
00:34:12,500 --> 00:34:13,699
you just the same?

646
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:18,599
You think this

647
00:34:20,579 --> 00:34:22,460
will move Yu Jinxuan?

648
00:34:24,539 --> 00:34:26,139
What about everything I've done

649
00:34:29,440 --> 00:34:30,480
for you these years?

650
00:34:39,179 --> 00:34:40,320
Wanqiao,

651
00:34:44,960 --> 00:34:45,840
I can never

652
00:34:48,559 --> 00:34:50,039
repay you in this life.

653
00:35:27,119 --> 00:35:28,079
Yu Jinxuan,

654
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:29,800
you're

655
00:35:31,400 --> 00:35:32,460
rid of me.

656
00:35:32,679 --> 00:35:34,840
You finally got what you wanted.

657
00:35:36,599 --> 00:35:37,679
You must be happy.

658
00:35:40,559 --> 00:35:41,840
Listen to me.

659
00:35:42,699 --> 00:35:43,800
In the next life,

660
00:35:46,000 --> 00:35:46,880
I'll never

661
00:35:49,760 --> 00:35:51,099
let you go.

662
00:36:16,199 --> 00:36:17,519
If only

663
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:22,260
we'd never

664
00:36:24,559 --> 00:36:26,260
have met

665
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:34,280
at that field hospital.

666
00:38:02,960 --> 00:38:03,699
Bingwen,

667
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:06,440
do you remember?

668
00:38:08,539 --> 00:38:10,360
When we were little, we went out to play

669
00:38:12,739 --> 00:38:13,599
and I twisted my ankle.

670
00:38:13,599 --> 00:38:14,599
I couldn't walk,

671
00:38:15,260 --> 00:38:17,059
so you carried me on your back all summer.

672
00:38:18,739 --> 00:38:20,300
That's when I knew

673
00:38:20,980 --> 00:38:22,079
you'd be

674
00:38:24,019 --> 00:38:25,619
the only one I'd ever love.

675
00:38:30,460 --> 00:38:31,219
Bingwen,

676
00:38:32,980 --> 00:38:34,059
in the next life,

677
00:38:37,579 --> 00:38:39,219
I don't want to be your sister.

678
00:39:30,980 --> 00:39:32,079
Miss,

679
00:39:32,079 --> 00:39:33,780
is this handkerchief yours?

680
00:39:38,519 --> 00:39:40,400
I lost this a long time ago.

681
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:42,199
Where did you find it?

682
00:39:42,579 --> 00:39:43,280
In an inside pocket

683
00:39:43,280 --> 00:39:44,800
of Mr. Kuang's clothes.

684
00:40:29,920 --> 00:40:30,519
Hey,

685
00:40:30,780 --> 00:40:31,559
stop staring.

686
00:40:32,380 --> 00:40:33,659
Dream on.

687
00:40:33,760 --> 00:40:34,460
That's

688
00:40:34,460 --> 00:40:35,980
Commander Yu's daughter.

689
00:40:36,139 --> 00:40:36,820
Yeah,

690
00:40:36,820 --> 00:40:38,460
she's way out of your league.

691
00:40:49,780 --> 00:40:50,380
Father.

692
00:40:51,260 --> 00:40:52,179
Come, meet Bingwen.

693
00:41:26,579 --> 00:41:27,940
Lilacs hardly ever grow

694
00:41:27,940 --> 00:41:29,219
in Nanhuai's climate,

695
00:41:29,500 --> 00:41:32,079
but this one's actually budding.

696
00:41:34,980 --> 00:41:36,019
As long as you love it,

697
00:41:36,559 --> 00:41:37,400
nothing's

698
00:41:37,980 --> 00:41:38,940
too hard.

699
00:42:28,719 --> 00:42:29,639
I'm sorry.

700
00:42:34,980 --> 00:42:36,219
We love each other,

701
00:42:37,039 --> 00:42:38,840
and I should have

702
00:42:41,539 --> 00:42:42,960
trusted you.

703
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:56,400
It's not your fault.

704
00:42:57,960 --> 00:43:01,159
You've been through enough.

705
00:43:02,179 --> 00:43:03,159
In the end,

706
00:43:04,460 --> 00:43:06,579
Bingwen did all this because of my family.

707
00:43:10,219 --> 00:43:11,940
You never have to apologize to me.

708
00:43:13,900 --> 00:43:14,780
I'm the one

709
00:43:16,460 --> 00:43:17,639
who failed to protect you.

710
00:43:26,760 --> 00:43:27,599
You said

711
00:43:28,440 --> 00:43:29,420
you wanted to do

712
00:43:29,420 --> 00:43:30,860
something more meaningful.

713
00:43:32,719 --> 00:43:33,559
I'll support you.

714
00:43:37,260 --> 00:43:38,059
Changxuan,

715
00:43:40,000 --> 00:43:41,960
I want to stay at the camp with you,

716
00:43:42,260 --> 00:43:43,500
nurse the wounded,

717
00:43:44,099 --> 00:43:45,300
and cover the war.

718
00:43:46,840 --> 00:43:48,900
I want to stand beside you,

719
00:43:50,360 --> 00:43:52,019
not just behind you.

720
00:43:56,699 --> 00:43:57,659
From now on,

721
00:43:58,639 --> 00:44:00,159
just follow your heart

722
00:44:01,900 --> 00:44:03,039
and do what you want.

723
00:44:27,760 --> 00:44:28,920
Kuang Bingwen lost.

724
00:44:30,699 --> 00:44:32,039
I didn't expect Yu Changxuan

725
00:44:32,900 --> 00:44:34,460
to have another trick up his sleeve.

726
00:44:37,000 --> 00:44:38,039
Even so,

727
00:44:39,400 --> 00:44:41,199
getting out of this war with Chu Wenfu

728
00:44:41,199 --> 00:44:42,420
won't be easy

729
00:44:43,500 --> 00:44:44,579
for the Yu family.

730
00:44:45,860 --> 00:44:47,179
That's right.

731
00:44:49,559 --> 00:44:50,619
Chu Wenfu is loyal

732
00:44:50,619 --> 00:44:51,880
to the central government.

733
00:44:52,960 --> 00:44:54,559
There's no telling

734
00:44:55,519 --> 00:44:56,820
who'll win

735
00:44:57,739 --> 00:44:59,099
until the very end.

736
00:44:59,780 --> 00:45:02,679
General Mu, you truly are a man of vision.

737
00:45:05,019 --> 00:45:06,440
Aways think of everything

738
00:45:07,119 --> 00:45:08,199
and plan ahead.

739
00:45:14,260 --> 00:45:15,639
The Japanese pulled strings,

740
00:45:16,619 --> 00:45:17,519
and the Tang family

741
00:45:17,519 --> 00:45:18,860
is on board.

742
00:45:19,679 --> 00:45:20,800
Taking a seat on the southern government's

743
00:45:20,800 --> 00:45:22,199
Legislative Council

744
00:45:23,400 --> 00:45:24,480
is a smart move.

745
00:45:25,119 --> 00:45:26,420
Legislators don't command troops,

746
00:45:27,119 --> 00:45:28,320
but they make the rules.

747
00:45:29,019 --> 00:45:30,139
Sometimes a piece

748
00:45:31,920 --> 00:45:33,800
of paper can do more than an entire army.

749
00:45:34,780 --> 00:45:35,739
Let's see

750
00:45:37,639 --> 00:45:38,719
if I can make Yu Changxuan

751
00:45:38,719 --> 00:45:40,579
play by my rules.

752
00:45:46,880 --> 00:45:48,440
- Papers!
- Newspaper!

753
00:45:48,800 --> 00:45:50,699
- Papers!
- Newspaper!

754
00:45:50,699 --> 00:45:53,980
Stop the civil war! Unite against invaders!

755
00:45:54,659 --> 00:45:58,300
Civil war ruins! Peace rebuilds!

756
00:45:58,599 --> 00:46:01,880
Stop the civil war! Unite against invaders!

757
00:46:02,559 --> 00:46:04,300
Civil war ruins!

758
00:46:30,380 --> 00:46:31,019
Sir,

759
00:46:31,400 --> 00:46:32,980
Chu and Mu's combined forces of 20,000 men

760
00:46:33,099 --> 00:46:34,119
are attacking us from both sides.

761
00:46:34,420 --> 00:46:36,019
Our lines are under heavy pressure.

762
00:46:36,300 --> 00:46:39,159
We've suffered great losses.

763
00:46:39,480 --> 00:46:40,360
The central government keeps

764
00:46:40,360 --> 00:46:41,639
supplying them with ammunition and funds.

765
00:46:41,980 --> 00:46:43,420
We're badly outmatched.

766
00:46:43,900 --> 00:46:45,159
This standoff

767
00:46:45,260 --> 00:46:46,480
is only buying us time.

768
00:46:46,480 --> 00:46:47,719
We want to fight,

769
00:46:48,039 --> 00:46:50,079
but I'm afraid it's a lost cause.

770
00:46:50,940 --> 00:46:53,599
This is a fight for survival.

771
00:46:54,179 --> 00:46:55,219
There's no retreat.

772
00:46:58,639 --> 00:46:59,500
Pass on my orders.

773
00:47:01,400 --> 00:47:03,559
All focus on defending their positions.

774
00:47:03,940 --> 00:47:05,239
Wear the enemy down

775
00:47:06,099 --> 00:47:07,440
and stretch their supply lines.

776
00:47:07,860 --> 00:47:09,440
They want a quick victory.

777
00:47:09,739 --> 00:47:11,800
We'll outmaneuver them.

778
00:47:12,719 --> 00:47:13,940
Tell every soldier

779
00:47:14,300 --> 00:47:15,420
I'll be right there

780
00:47:15,860 --> 00:47:17,679
with them on the front line.

781
00:47:17,920 --> 00:47:18,559
Yes.

782
00:47:32,480 --> 00:47:33,239
Changxuan?

783
00:47:37,820 --> 00:47:39,239
You haven't slept in days.

784
00:47:39,820 --> 00:47:40,920
You can't keep pushing yourself.

785
00:47:41,059 --> 00:47:41,860
I'll get the medic.

786
00:47:42,579 --> 00:47:43,159
Come back.

787
00:47:45,300 --> 00:47:46,719
